{39}{Hmmm.  I suppose you're none to blame, stranger.  Perhaps I'm a little quick-tempered myself. Please, forgive my harsh words.  You may call me Magnus.}{Hmmm.  I suppose you're none to blame, stranger.  Perhaps I'm a little quick-tempered myself. Please, forgive my harsh words.  You may call me Magnus.}{}{7}{}{lf6 1}
