{85}{Strange?  Strange doesn't begin to describe what they are.  Do you know that no one has seen the supposed owner, Pelonious Schuyler, OR his sons, in more than 15 years?  And even then, the gentlemen who saw them, a trader in gems from Arland, died a week later from what they could only describe as "consumption"...}{Strange?  Strange doesn't begin to describe what they are.  Do you know that no one has seen the supposed owner, Pelonious Schuyler, OR his sons, in more than 15 years?  And even then, the gentlemen who saw them, a trader in gems from Arland, died a week later from what they could only describe as "consumption"...}{}{16}{}{gf1025 1, ru 2032}
