{704}{Gilbert Bates?  Who doesn't know him?  He invented the steam engine!  For a human, he's quite a sharp fellow.  Of course, the dwarves are the most skilled technologists.  But everyone knows that...}{Gilbert Bates?  Who doesn't know him?  He invented the steam engine!  For a human, he's quite a sharp fellow.  Of course, the dwarves are the most skilled technologists.  But everyone knows that...}{}{101}{}{}
