{708}{What?  An island?  No self-respecting dwarf makes it his business to know about islands!  Too much bloody water around it!  Give a dwarf mountains and valleys, but keep him away from water!  Uggh!  The thought...!}{What?  An island?  No self-respecting dwarf makes it his business to know about islands!  Too much bloody water around it!  Give a dwarf mountains and valleys, but keep him away from water!  Uggh!  The thought...!}{}{102}{}{}
