{712}{Didn't we already go over this?  I don't know a bloody thing about islands, and if I did, I sure wouldn't want to know about someplace called the Isle of Despair!  I've known some slow learners, but....[mumble.]}{Didn't we already go over this?  I don't know a bloody thing about islands, and if I did, I sure wouldn't want to know about someplace called the Isle of Despair!  I've known some slow learners, but....[mumble.]}{}{103}{}{}
