{716}{Are you serious?  Me...Magnus Shale Fist...know how to get to Qintarra?  WHY THE BLOODY HELL WOULD I KNOW HOW TO GET TO QINTARRA?  I'd rather cut my beard than be caught dead in such a place!  Qintarra!  Elves!  Accchhh!}{Are you serious?  Me...Magnus Shale Fist...know how to get to Qintarra?  WHY THE BLOODY HELL WOULD I KNOW HOW TO GET TO QINTARRA?  I'd rather cut my beard than be caught dead in such a place!  Qintarra!  Elves!  Accchhh!}{}{104}{}{}
