{720}{Oh...yes.  The Wheel Clan is the ruling clan over ALL dwarves in Arcanum.  Their clan chieftain, and our King, is Logahaire Thunder Stone.  He is a fierce warrior, and wise.  Not that those qualities are uncommon in dwarves, of course...}{Oh...yes.  The Wheel Clan is the ruling clan over ALL dwarves in Arcanum.  Their clan chieftain, and our King, is Logahaire Thunder Stone.  He is a fierce warrior, and wise.  Not that those qualities are uncommon in dwarves, of course...}{}{105}{}{}
