{732}{Nasrudin?  Isn't he the fellow that those bloody Panarii are always chanting over?  We dwarves put little stake in long-dead elves, as I'm sure you can well imagine.  [He squints at you.]  Wait...aren't you supposed to be him, or some such foolishness?  This whole thing gives me a headache...}{Nasrudin?  Isn't he the fellow that those bloody Panarii are always chanting over?  We dwarves put little stake in long-dead elves, as I'm sure you can well imagine.  [He squints at you.]  Wait...aren't you supposed to be him, or some such foolishness?  This whole thing gives me a headache...}{}{108}{}{}
