{736}{I'm not quite sure I heard you right.  Were you asking me about islands again?  I KNOW you weren't asking me about islands. }{I'm not quite sure I heard you right.  Were you asking me about islands again?  I KNOW you weren't asking me about islands. }{}{109}{}{}
{737}{One or two more things...}{}{5}{}{400}{}
{738}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{740}{The Ring of Brodgar?  My family visited there once, when I was younger.  They've got quite a gift shop there, from what I remember...but the whole time I was there I felt sick.  I think the damned place is stained with magick, or at least that's what legend tells...}{The Ring of Brodgar?  My family visited there once, when I was younger.  They've got quite a gift shop there, from what I remember...but the whole time I was there I felt sick.  I think the damned place is stained with magick, or at least that's what legend tells...}{}{110}{}{}
