{742}{E:}{}{5}{}{0}{}
{744}{Why in hell would you think I'd know such a bloody thing?  I have a hard enough time keeping you out of trouble.  Now you want me to find this Arronax as well?  I know that dwarves are resourceful, but even I have my limits!}{Why in hell would you think I'd know such a bloody thing?  I have a hard enough time keeping you out of trouble.  Now you want me to find this Arronax as well?  I know that dwarves are resourceful, but even I have my limits!}{}{111}{}{}
