{1000}{How dare you speak of treaties with these creatures?  Will you ignore the crimes they have committed against my people?  Does the friendship I've offered to you mean anything?}{How dare you speak of treaties with these creatures?  Will you ignore the crimes they have committed against my people?  Does the friendship I've offered to you mean anything?}{}{115}{}{}
{1001}{Magnus, please...let's think about this...}{}{5}{}{1003}{}
{1002}{Of course!  Forgive a momentary weakness, Magnus.  Attack!}{}{5}{}{-19}{}
{1003}{Fine. If I must, l will fight them, even alone.  But I ask you one last time...please!  Join me against these monsters, and help me to avenge my people!  We've fought together as brothers, as friends!  I've bled with you!  Don't turn on me now!}{Fine. If I must, l will fight them, even alone.  But I ask you one last time...please!  Join me against these monsters, and help me to avenge my people!  We've fought together as brothers, as friends!  I've bled with you!  Don't turn on me now!}{}{116}{}{}
