{1007}{Look!  It's an ancient dwarven burial ground!}{Look!  It's an ancient dwarven burial ground!}{}{117}{}{}
{1008}{I can't believe what's been done here!  It's a travesty!}{I can't believe what's been done here!  It's a travesty!}{}{118}{}{}
{1009}{Gods!  They're using dwarven zombies to do this grisly work!  These truly are my lost people, and their resting place has been desecrated!}{Gods!  They're using dwarven zombies to do this grisly work!  These truly are my lost people, and their resting place has been desecrated!}{}{119}{}{}
{1010}{Magnus...are you sure?  These dwarves look strange...}{}{1}{pa -6409}{1013}{}
{1011}{Magnus...are you sure?  These dwarves look strange...}{}{1}{pa 6409}{-25}{}
{1013}{Strange?  Of course they look strange!  They've been raised from the dead to work as mindless laborers!  You'd look strange too, if someone did the same to you!  When I find out who's responsible, there's a price that's going to be paid...}{Strange?  Of course they look strange!  They've been raised from the dead to work as mindless laborers!  You'd look strange too, if someone did the same to you!  When I find out who's responsible, there's a price that's going to be paid...}{}{120}{}{}
{1014}{Let's find out what's going on here, first...}{}{1}{}{}{fl 1017}
{1015}{I'm with you, Magnus.  Something has to be done...}{}{1}{}{}{fl 1018}
{1017}{Do what you will. I'm going do whatever I feel is necessary.}{Do what you will. I'm going do whatever I feel is necessary.}{}{121}{}{}
{1018}{Good!  Then I can count on you to fight by my side...}{Good!  Then I can count on you to fight by my side...}{}{122}{}{}
